# type(scope): imperative summary in English, lowercase, no trailing period (max. 72)
#
# Types: feat fix perf refactor style docs test build ci chore revert
# Scopes: library libraries import queue player voice translation recognition
#         export access api webhooks youtube ui desktop docker docs
#
# Body: one bullet per change, grouped by area (app, server, desktop, docs…),
# saying what changed and why.
#
# Optional footers:
#   BREAKING CHANGE: what stops working and how to migrate
#   Docs: n/a
